    "references": [
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 0",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 0,
          "component_id": "8fd2cbe0-a07d-5e99-85a4-83ab40c15770",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 297,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:0",
          "start": 0
        },
        "quote": "Home occupations shall be permitted provided the same do not detract from the residential character of a neighborhood and will not cause excessive traffic, nuisance or hazards to safety; provided further, that each home occupation shall comply with the following standards and permit requirements:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "eb724b60-7ec5-5f14-9d05-44fe74adae02",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 450,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:1",
          "start": 298
        },
        "quote": "(a) The following home occupations are exempt from the standards in subsections (b) and (c) of this section and do not require a home occupation permit:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "e9dead77-69fe-5d92-8238-34e0386a7b92",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 646,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:2",
          "start": 451
        },
        "quote": "(1) Home occupations having no customers or clients coming to or conducting business in the dwelling; and no employees working at or parking vheicles on the property associated with the dwelling.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "810ab6a8-9dfe-57f9-b527-230b0766f6eb",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 944,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:3",
          "start": 647
        },
        "quote": "(2) Examples of home occupations in subsection (b) of this section include but are not limited to residents using their home as a remote place of work; sales or services conducted exclusively via the internet; professional office; artist or craft studio; or activities of similar or lesser impact.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "a8db433f-0776-58ea-9532-af8b42fe4881",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1136,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:4",
          "start": 945
        },
        "quote": "(3) In-home day care and hosted short-term residential rental operations are regulated by other provisions and regulations of the development code and do not require a home occupation permit.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "b80805f1-51c7-5e18-b7c6-b42ce56ba6a1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1276,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:5",
          "start": 1137
        },
        "quote": "(b) Standards. The following shall apply to all home occupations except those home occupations described in subsection (a) of this section:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "92cfa4ac-2d99-582d-9c4a-bba99d6f734e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1351,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:6",
          "start": 1277
        },
        "quote": "(1) The use or activity shall be carried on by a resident of the dwelling.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "6a60bbbe-5ffb-5910-aeb3-7a8279cacda6",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1443,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:7",
          "start": 1352
        },
        "quote": "(2) Not more than one employee not a resident of the dwelling is permitted at any one time.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "f822719f-5b19-56a5-882a-f050de93e972",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1681,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:8",
          "start": 1444
        },
        "quote": "(3) The exterior of the dwelling shall not be changed or modified in any way, nor shall any exterior signs be erected that will indicate any accessory use of the property or adversely affect the residential character of the neighborhood.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "460ce6d2-e472-5eab-9bc3-8d046343a312",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1761,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:9",
          "start": 1682
        },
        "quote": "(4) The sale of any commodity, goods or products on the premises is prohibited.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "2e631e8a-ec08-5a08-b0e9-b8f4dcde1cbe",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1939,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:10",
          "start": 1762
        },
        "quote": "(5) All equipment, materials, work in progress and work areas shall be confined to the principal dwelling and not extend into an attached or detached garage or storage building.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "edccba03-dd63-5a3f-8571-4b9330973e3c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2035,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:11",
          "start": 1940
        },
        "quote": "(6) The projection of any obnoxious sound, odor, smoke, vibration, light or dust is prohibited.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "3dfc417d-a314-5e3c-92c1-e1d6e94b375b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2192,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:12",
          "start": 2036
        },
        "quote": "(7) The home occupation shall not occupy more than 25 percent of the total floor area (including a basement) of the dwelling, excluding any attached garage.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "16a57c37-0753-5481-a225-c7ea1fbf5233",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2317,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:13",
          "start": 2193
        },
        "quote": "(8) The home occupation shall not be available or open to the public except during the hours between 8:00 a.m. and 8:00 p.m.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "826cdd6c-ba97-53be-b60b-49ef4035cc04",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2590,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:14",
          "start": 2318
        },
        "quote": "(9) The home occupation shall not create a need for off-street parking, pedestrian and vehicular traffic, sanitary sewer and storm sewer usage, public water usage as well as other municipal services in excess of the normal and usual levels for other residential dwellings.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 15",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 15,
          "component_id": "6290671d-f03f-56b8-9db7-529ea5870b3a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2727,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:15",
          "start": 2591
        },
        "quote": "(10) Only one such accessory use or activity shall be carried on in a dwelling during the period authorized by a home occupation permit.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:15#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 16",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 16,
          "component_id": "a59b6ec4-be0e-5e71-bd13-f059f2fd9e4e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3186,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:16",
          "start": 2728
        },
        "quote": "(c) Permit Required. Prior to the establishment of any accessory use or activity as defined herein as a home occupation, the owner(s) of the subject property shall make an application to the Planning Department. At such time as the Planning Director has determined that the proposed accessory use or activity meets the standards as set forth herein, a home occupation permit shall be issued. The permit fees shall be as prescribed by the City’s fee schedule.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:16#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 17",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 17,
          "component_id": "d6385e37-aa81-57ae-aa56-95dfe8cbd5e8",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3357,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:17",
          "start": 3187
        },
        "quote": "(1) The Planning Director shall have the authority to specify conditions and requirements as deemed necessary to assure compliance with the standards as set forth herein.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:17#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 18",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 18,
          "component_id": "c415aefe-2e2b-50de-8fa4-676d19993b34",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3572,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:18",
          "start": 3358
        },
        "quote": "(2) The home occupation permit shall specify the conditions, requirements and duration of said permit. The permit shall be displayed within the interior of the dwelling and at the location of the proposed activity.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:18#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 19",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 19,
          "component_id": "a3c70d43-287a-5ab9-a989-fc0ff6d16d0c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3804,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:19",
          "start": 3573
        },
        "quote": "(3) A home occupation permit may be issued to a tenant or occupant of a dwelling who is to be engaged in the accessory use or activity, provided the owner(s) of record of the property have endorsed and/or certified the application.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:19#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 20",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 20,
          "component_id": "31e253e2-3a4c-56c3-95a3-1da9a4901f96",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3989,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:20",
          "start": 3805
        },
        "quote": "(4) A home occupation permit shall not be transferable or assignable. Discontinuance or abandonment of the home occupation for a period of 60 days or more shall render the permit void.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:20#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 21",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 21,
          "component_id": "03773197-2991-5721-84c4-a64c9e878bff",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4721,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:21",
          "start": 3990
        },
        "quote": "(d) Enforcement. The enforcement and administration of this section shall rest with the Planning Director. Upon a finding that any of the foregoing provisions have not been complied with, the Planning Director shall direct the home occupation permit invalid and shall order the use therein to be vacated. The Planning Director shall have the right to inspect the premises at any reasonable time. Failure to allow periodic inspections by Planning Director at any reasonable time shall result in the immediate revocation of the home occupation permit. In the event of a revocation, one year shall elapse prior to an application by the same owner of the same residential dwelling structure for a new permit. (Ord. 20639 § 1, 2-17-26.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:21#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.210.035 block 22",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 22,
          "component_id": "494ddb11-59bd-542d-9336-251a68f93c46",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4791,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:22",
          "start": 4722
        },
        "quote": "Cross References: Planning and Development Department, TMC 2.20.080 .",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.210.035:block:22#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
